{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"腾讯的文化与价值观","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"user-oriented-philosophy","title":"用户为本：腾讯的产品哲学基石","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/user-oriented-philosophy","wordCount":2457,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"tech-for-good","title":"科技向善：从商业至上到使命升级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/tech-for-good","wordCount":2338,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"tencent-culture-evolution","title":"腾讯文化三次进化：危机驱动的自我革新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/tencent-culture-evolution","wordCount":2353,"readingTime":10},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-and-vision","title":"腾讯的使命与愿景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/mission-and-vision","wordCount":3089,"readingTime":13},{"seq":5,"slug":"core-values-detail","title":"腾讯核心价值观详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/core-values-detail","wordCount":3522,"readingTime":15},{"seq":6,"slug":"culture-practice","title":"腾讯文化的落地机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/culture-practice","wordCount":3419,"readingTime":14}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"腾讯的文化与价值观\">腾讯的文化与价值观</h1><p>本章探讨腾讯企业文化的核心理念与实践。从&quot;用户为本&quot;的产品哲学基石，到&quot;科技向善&quot;的社会责任承诺，再到价值观体系的三次历史迭代，全方位解读腾讯的文化基因。</p>\n<p>本章包含六篇文档：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>用户为本</strong>：腾讯最底层的产品哲学，从马化腾的 10/100/1000 法则到张小龙的&quot;用完即走&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>科技向善</strong>：腾讯如何将社会责任融入技术与产品</li>\n<li><strong>文化演变史</strong>：从文化 1.0 到 3.0 的三次迭代</li>\n<li><strong>使命与愿景</strong>：深度解读&quot;用户为本，科技向善&quot;的内涵与张力</li>\n<li><strong>核心价值观详解</strong>：正直、进取、协作、创造四大价值观的行为标准与落地机制</li>\n<li><strong>文化落地机制</strong>：瑞雪体系、腾讯学堂、文化仪式等制度化手段</li>\n</ul>\n"}